WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:06.640
In 1846, the Daily News became London's newest
newspaper.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:15.799
Its editor-in-chief was none other than author
Charles Dickens.

00:00:15.799 --> 00:00:19.820
Diamonds are actually unstable at surface
temperature and pressure.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:26.590
Every diamond above ground is very, very slowly
altering into graphite, another form of pure

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:27.590
carbon.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:34.650
It is impossible to spell a word only using
the bottom row of a QWERTY keyboard.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:39.920
Medieval Japanese samurai burned incense in
their helmets so that if they were decapitated

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:42.910
in battle, their head would smell sweet.

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:48.320
The lion costume in the film Wizard of Oz
was made from real lions.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:54.800
The "S" in Harry S. Truman didn't stand for
anything; Truman had a middle initial but

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:57.200
no middle name.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:05.400
Owls are not only carnivores but also cannibals,
who may eat other owls of a different species.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:11.010
Most supermarkets place their bakery areas
near the entrance because studies have shown

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:16.310
that the aroma of fresh-baked goods makes
customers spend more money.

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:22.170
Despite being staples of the Old West landscape,
neither horses nor tumbleweeds are native

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:23.510
to North America.

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:30.750
A baby can cost new parents 750 hours of sleep
in the first year.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:38.630
The first VCR, developed by the Ampex Corporation
in 1956, weighed nearly 680 kg.

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:44.659
It took another 15 years before a commercially
viable product hit the scene.

00:01:44.659 --> 00:01:50.570
Kiribati is the only country that falls in
all four hemispheres.

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:57.320
Only a few species of dinosaurs ate meat,
the majority of dinosaurs were herbivores.

00:01:57.320 --> 00:02:02.470
Goldfish can distinguish the music of one
composer from another.

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:08.060
The flashes of colored light you see when
you rub your eyes are called "phosphenes."

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:11.500
To save money when you shop, don't touch anything.

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:16.680
Touching an item makes you more likely to
buy it, and be more willing to pay more for

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.909
it.

